<title>CANADA: Bre-X says Indonesia wants Barrick in Busang.</title>
<headline>Bre-X says Indonesia wants Barrick in Busang.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bre-X Minerals Ltd said on Tuesday it was advised by the Indonesia government to split its world-class Busang gold deposit in Indonesia with Barrick Gold Corp.</p>
<p>Bre-X said that Indonesia wants Toronto-based Barrick to hold 75 percent of Busang. It said the government wants Calgary-based Bre-X to complete a deal with Barrick by December 4.</p>
</text>
